Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:12.43,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}夜空を見上げて
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:20.35,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}花火に願い事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:28.15,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}約束　ずっと
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:44.42,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}真昼の陽炎　坂道で追い越す
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:49.17,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}たくさんの笑顔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:56.80,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}指折り数えてた
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:04.10,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}忘れない　まだ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:16.36,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}耳を澄ませば聞こえる足音も
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:22.75,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}駆け寄るあの笑い声も
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:34.76,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}青い空へと還る思い出の中へ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:45.35,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}二つの手を繋いだ夏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:57.20,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}今はもう
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:06.54,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}あの遥かへ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:22.76,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}夜空を見上げて
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:37.03,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}花火に　願いと　笑顔を
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:12.43,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}仰望夜空
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:20.35,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}向煙火許下願望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:28.15,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}不變的約定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:44.42,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}在坡道上  穿過了正午的熱浪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:49.17,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}扳著手指
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:56.80,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}細數那眾多的笑臉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:04.10,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}歷歷在目
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:16.36,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}靜下心來傾聽到的腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:22.75,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}以及漸漸靠近的笑聲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:34.76,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}那些回憶都將一同回到藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:45.35,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}回到那手牽著手的夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:57.20,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}現在早已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:06.54,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}朝著那遠方而去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:22.76,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}抬頭仰望夜空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:37.03,INCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be8}將心願與笑容託付與煙火
